  "limitations": [
    "Digitized chart approximation, not raw dyno measurements or a validated calibration of an individual damper.",
    "Positive plotted force is assigned to compression and negative to rebound; the PDF does not explicitly label branch directions. Verify this convention against a known-direction dyno test.",
    "First sampled speed is 12.5 mm/s; origin is imposed and the interval to that sample is linear. Near-zero hysteresis is not modeled.",
    "R12 LS25/HS4.3 at 12.5 mm/s is occluded; that point is linearly interpolated between the imposed origin and the 20 mm/s sample.",
    "Pixel medians collapse multivalued loops. Gas force, friction, temperature and acceleration dependence are not separately identified.",
    "Only C12/R12: LS=0..25 at HS=4.3, or HS=0..4.3 at LS=0. Interpolation between settings is an approximation.",
    "The common LS0/HS4.3 endpoint uses the low-speed sweep. Maximum calibrated speed is 0.25 m/s; terminal-slope extrapolation is unmeasured."
